/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
214 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 494 0 R
/E (Privilege Leave: After 12 months of continuous service, employees are entitled to 12 days of Privilege Leaves during the following 12-months period. These leaves will be credited on a monthly basis \(1 day per month\). Privilege Leave can be accumulated up to a maximum of 45 days. Upon cessation of employment, upto 15 days of unused Privilege Leave can be encashed. Encashment will be based on the Basic Pay component of the employee.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
215 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 495 0 R
